    description: "Fashions weapons and tools from natural materials (wood, bone, teeth, hide, sinew, plant fiber) and enchants them to emulate magic, by the same process a Techno-Wizard uses on a machine, with organic parts in place of manufactured ones. Anyone with enough P.P.E. or I.S.P. can use such a device, and anyone can use one on a ley line. The Eco-Wizard can also work out how to use and power Techno-Wizard weapons, but not how to build them. The items are the EW gear rows of this book (printed 83-95)."
