extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 26: Dinosaur Swamp printed 64-66 (cache p065-p067, cache page = printed folio + 1), read off the OCR and checked against 150 dpi renders of printed 64 (right column), 65 (both columns) and 66 (left column). The entry starts at the Barbarian Eco-Wizard O.C.C. heading on printed 64 and ends at Cybernetics on printed 66, above the Mutant Barbarian R.C.C. heading. || GROUP: under the section heading Barbarians (printed 59-69). The entry calls the Eco-Wizard a sorcerer and lists Magic Related Bonuses and a P.P.E. base, so occ_group is magic; it states no S.D.C. base, only +2D6 to physical S.D.C., so men_of_arms is false. || XP: the second column of the Experience Point Tables, printed 74 (cache p075), which the table gives to the Eco-Wizard alone; read off a 300 dpi render by the row 3a worker, every low bound the previous high plus one. || POOLS: hit points are not printed; P.E. + 1D6 per level as for the book''s other O.C.C.s. P.P.E. 2D4x10 + P.E., +2D6 per additional level. I.S.P. M.E. + 1D6, +1D6 per level. || BONUSES: +2D6 S.D.C. and +1D4 M.A. (Special O.C.C. Bonuses); +2 vs Horror Factor and possession; +1 vs magic at levels 2, 5, 9, 12 and 15 (spell_magic); the +1 to save vs insect bites, poisonous snakes, infection and disease at 2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 12 and 14 is stored as the disease save only, because a bite or venom is a subset of poisons and conditional. +1 Spell Strength at 3, 7 and 9 has no bonus field and is display text in level_progression. || MAGIC (2026-10-20): the page grants twelve held invocations by name at first level and a schedule of new ones (two from levels 1-4 at 2, 4, 8 and 13; one from levels 5-8 at 3, 6, 9, 12 and 15), stored as the magic block. The book adds no new spells (the survey counts zero); the row brief''s reading that the Eco-Wizard has no spell list was corrected against printed 64. Spell levels in the printed list: Blinding Flash 1, Electric Arc 8, Globe of Daylight 2, Ignite Fire 6, Fuel Flame 5, Fire Bolt 7, Magic Shield 6, Manipulate Objects 2+, Energy Bolt 5, Create Wood 10+, Life Source 2+, Power Weapon 35 (P.P.E. costs, as printed). The half-effect penalty on cast spells is prose. || PSIONICS: Minor, two powers from Healing or Sensitive. || SKILLS: each base is the catalog base plus the printed bonus. Fashion Weapons & Tools is this book''s special skill, held at 40/5 as printed. Identify Plants & Fruits is the catalog Identify Plants & Fruit; the language of choice at +10% is Language: Other; Speak Native Language at 92% is Language: Native Tongue. Row boats are read as Boat: Paddle Types/Canoe/Kayak; Motorcycle is Motorcycles & Snowmobiles; Hovercycle is Hovercycles, Skycycles & Rocket Bikes. Technical +10% applies to Language and Lore through only_prefix; building related skills is not a list the catalog can match, so it is in the note. No Heavy Weapons is the two catalog W.P. Heavy rows; the catalog has no Sharpshooting row and does not separate Ancient from Modern. The secondary skills paragraph says R.C.C. Related list; the class prints only an O.C.C. related list, which is used. Hand to Hand Basic only, cannot be upgraded: costs {}. || EQUIPMENT: clothes, boots or moccasins, utility belt, large backpack, two canteens, skinning knives (three stored for several), 1D6 animal snares. Not stored: the sinew, bones and leather hide for constructs; the hide armor with two or three magic features of choice; one weapon per W.P. with at least one enchanted (Sickness Spears and Skin Nets are common). Those are EW items of this book, named in the body and not added again. || NOT STORED: the G.M. option of one or two unique starting weapons."
